From: Watchdog Refactor <watchdog@refactor.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Complete watchdog architecture refactor

Fix critical watchdog issues:
- Separate TWDT and health monitoring states
- Fix tasks calling esp_task_wdt_reset() without subscription
- Proper task registration verification
- Safe startup sequence with health-only monitoring

Signed-off-by: Watchdog Refactor <watchdog@refactor.com>

